The file sioux-center-roads.osm.pbf is OpenStreetMap data.
Copyright OpenStreetMap contributors, licensed under the Open Database License 1.0.
https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright
https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/

The data was retrieved from the public Overpass API and converted without changing
its OSM elements. The request, source time, conversion and hashes are in source.json.
Individual OSM objects retain their source attribution and version metadata.
This dataset is separate from VentusIQ application code licensed under Apache-2.0.
